--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/mariadb-table-charset-caf1940283bc5fec.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The ``nodegroup``, ``federation`` and ``magnum_service`` tables are now
+    created with the same ``UTF8`` character set as magnum's other tables.
+    From MariaDB 11.5 a table that declares a character set and a table that
+    declares none no longer receive the same collation, so a new deployment
+    failed in the ``nodegroups_v2`` migration with ``Illegal mix of
+    collations (utf8mb3_general_ci,IMPLICIT) and
+    (utf8mb3_uca1400_ai_ci,IMPLICIT) for operation '='``. Existing
+    deployments are unaffected, because the migrations that create these
+    tables have already run for them.
